# ============================================================
# HOW IT WORKS
# ============================================================
#
# System automatically tries providers in order:
#
#   1. Twilio     (Fast, reliable)      → If fails...
#   2. AWS SNS    (Cheapest)            → If fails...
#   3. Vonage     (Good backup)         → If fails...
#   4. Plivo      (Another backup)      → If fails...
#   5. TextBelt   (Free, 1/day limit)   → Last resort
#
# You only need to configure ONE provider to start.
# System will automatically use free provider if others fail.
#
# Recommended: Configure Twilio + AWS SNS for robust failover.
#
# ============================================================
# AUTONOMOUS SETUP OPTIONS
# ============================================================
#
# Option 1: Quick setup (Twilio only)
#   ./scripts/setup_sms_providers.sh --quick
#
# Option 2: Full setup (All providers)
#   ./scripts/setup_sms_providers.sh --full
#
# Option 3: Auto-provision (System handles it)
#   ./scripts/setup_sms_providers.sh --autonomous
#
# Option 4: Manual
#   Fill in credentials above, system auto-detects
#
# ============================================================
# HEALTH MONITORING
# ============================================================
#
# System automatically:
# - Monitors provider health
# - Tracks success/failure rates
# - Routes around unhealthy providers
# - Optimizes for cost
# - Reports statistics
#
# Check health: python3 autonomous/sms_provider_manager.py --stats
#
# ============================================================
# COST OPTIMIZATION
# ============================================================
#
# System automatically uses cheapest available provider.
# Override with priority settings if you prefer reliability.
#
# Current priority (can be customized):
#   1. Twilio   (most reliable)
#   2. AWS SNS  (cheapest)
#   3. Vonage   (good balance)
#   4. Plivo    (alternative)
#   5. TextBelt (free backup)
#
# ============================================================
